From: Gili Tzabari <cowwoc2020@gmail.com>
From: Gili Tzabari <cowwoc2020@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 02:59:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] bugfix: preserve Windows command output on capture failure

Retain partial output and report capture failures through the execution
and protocol boundaries instead of silently losing command results. A command
that exited with 0 but whose output was truncated by a pipe read error is
reported with exit code 253 (`EXEC_OUTPUT_TRUNCATED_EXIT_CODE`); a non-zero exit
code of the command itself is kept.

